"Write a Python expression that evaluates to a dict of URL query parameters (<code>?key=value</code>).\n"
"                                Use <code>rec</code> to access the current record.\n"
"                                Example: <code>{\"id\": rec.external_id, \"lang\": \"th\"}</code>"
